The serial is "9,3,4,#,#,1,#,#,2,#,6,#,#".
The tokens is split serial by ",".
The slots is 1.
The valid is 1.
For each token in tokens.
Subtract 1 from slots.
If slots is less than 0, set valid to 0.
If slots is less than 0, break.
If token does not match "#", add 2 to slots.

If valid is 1 and slots is 0, show true, otherwise show false.
